title RF27 — RoomService.statesOf(): estado calculado\nDiagrama de máquina de estados — gerado do código em 2026-10-06 (scripts/diagramas/v5)\nmarcadores acumuláveis · 10 regras no código

state "RoomService.statesOf()" as C_statesOf {
  state C_statesOf_avaliar <<choice>>
  state "INDISPONIVEL" as C_statesOf_INDISPONIVEL
  state "ESQUECIDA" as C_statesOf_ESQUECIDA
  state "FAVORITA" as C_statesOf_FAVORITA
  state "ICONE" as C_statesOf_ICONE
  state "A_VENDA" as C_statesOf_A_VENDA
  state "LOOK_DO_DIA" as C_statesOf_LOOK_DO_DIA
  state "CADEIRA" as C_statesOf_CADEIRA
  state "FORA_DE_ESTACAO" as C_statesOf_FORA_DE_ESTACAO
  state "CROQUI" as C_statesOf_CROQUI
  state "GARIMPO" as C_statesOf_GARIMPO
}
[*] --> C_statesOf_avaliar : cada leitura
C_statesOf_avaliar --> C_statesOf_INDISPONIVEL : [1] unavailable
C_statesOf_avaliar --> C_statesOf_ESQUECIDA : [2] senão, forgotten(w, lastUse(w,\nlastDiary), today)
C_statesOf_avaliar --> C_statesOf_FAVORITA : [3] w.isFavorite()
C_statesOf_avaliar --> C_statesOf_ICONE : [4] iconPieceName != null && w.getName() !=\nnull &&\nw.getName().equalsIgnoreCase(iconPieceName)
C_statesOf_avaliar --> C_statesOf_A_VENDA : [5] w.isForSale()
C_statesOf_avaliar --> C_statesOf_LOOK_DO_DIA : [6] dailyLookPieces.contains(w.getId())
C_statesOf_avaliar --> C_statesOf_CADEIRA : [7] a != null && a.zone().equals('chair')
C_statesOf_avaliar --> C_statesOf_FORA_DE_ESTACAO : [8] a != null && a.zone().equals('season')
C_statesOf_avaliar --> C_statesOf_CROQUI : [9] w.getImageUrl() == null ||\nw.getPhotoProcessingStatus() ==\nPhotoProcessingStatus.NEEDS_REUPLOAD ||\nw.getPhotoProcessingStatus() ==\nPhotoProcessingStatus.FAILED
C_statesOf_avaliar --> C_statesOf_GARIMPO : [10] 'GARIMPADA'.equalsIgnoreCase(w.getPieceOrigin())
note right of C_statesOf
  Os marcadores não são gravados nem exclusivos:
  cada regra verdadeira acrescenta o seu.
end note
